    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-prov23">
        <head xml:id="gom-prov23-Hd1e98">Caput 23</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov23-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov23-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov23-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_1@1-2">Quando sederis.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e109"><seg type="qs">Allegorice legendum est</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">unde bene subjungit:</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov23-Dd1e118">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov23-Hd1e120">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov23-d1e122">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e124" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_3@1-2">Ne desideres,</quote>
            hoc est, ne desideres <pb ed="#P" n="1106B"/> ejus auscultare sermonibus, qui dulcedine mendacii auditores fallit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov23-Dd1e131">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov23-Hd1e133">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov23-d1e135">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e137" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_4@8-9">Pone modum.</quote>
            De quo <ref xml:id="gom-prov23-Rd1e140">supra: <seg type="incipit">Ne transgrediaris terminos antiquos quos posuerunt patres</seg>,</ref> scilicet terminos fidei, et veritatis datae a patribus.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov23-Dd1e148">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov23-Hd1e150">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov23-d1e152">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e154" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_6@1-2">Ne comedas,</quote>
            id est, ne de Scripturis cum haeretico loquaris, qui invidet humanae saluti, malens decipere quam corrigi; quoniam sicut hariolus et conjectator somniorum, aestimat, quae ignorat; ita haereticus, quae non intelligit in Scripturis, ut libet interpretatur?
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov23-d1e158">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e160" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_6@2-2">Comede,</quote>
            etc. Securus, inquit, disce, quae dico, et age quae doceo; cum in his, quae docet, ipse fidem <pb ed="#P" n="1106C"/> certam non habeat, sciens se finxisse, quae docet.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov23-Dd1e168">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov23-Hd1e170">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov23-d1e172">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e174" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_8@1-3">Cibos quos comederas.</quote>
            Sensus perversos, quos ab haereticis didiceras necesse est, ut vel per poenitentiam corrigendus deseras, vel pro his post mortem poenas sustineas, perdasque sermones confessionis, quibus eis praedicantibus humiliter favendum esse putaveras.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov23-Dd1e179">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov23-Hd1e181">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov23-d1e183">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e185" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_9">In auribus. Nolite sanctum dare canibus, neque mittas margaritas ante porcos.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            Sicut admonuit, ne haereticorum doctrinis auscultares: ita nunc, ne amore vanae gloriae seductus immundis hominibus passim arcana veritatis ingeras.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov23-Dd1e192">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov23-Hd1e194">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov23-d1e196">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e198" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_10@1-2">Ne attingas,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e201"><seg type="qs">Propinquum parvulorum et pupillorum Dominum appellat</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">qui conversationem eorum bonam inquietando <pb ed="#P" n="1106D"/> laeserit, judicium Domini non evadit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov23-Dd1e212">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov23-Hd1e214">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov23-d1e216">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e218" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_17@1-5">Non aemuletur cor tuum peccatores.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e221"><seg type="qs">Si tota die</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">unde in Apocalypsi: <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e227" source="http://scta.info/resource/ap2_10@22-31">Esto fidelis usque ad mortem, et dabo tibi coronam vitae</quote>.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov23-Dd1e233">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov23-Hd1e235">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov23-d1e237">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e239" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_20@1-4">Noli esse in conviviis peccatorum.</quote>
            Carnes ad vescendum conferre, est in collocutione derogationis vicissim vitia proximorum dicere: de quorum poena mox subditur: <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e242" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_21@1-3">Quia vacant potibus,</quote> etc.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov23-Dd1e247">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov23-Hd1e249">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov23-d1e251">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e253" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_21@5-7">Dantes symbola consumentur.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e256"><seg type="qs">Symbolum, collatio</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">detractionis suae languor occupavit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov23-Dd1e266">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov23-Hd1e268">Versus 29</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov23-d1e270">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e272" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_29@1-3">Cui vae, cujus.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e275"><seg type="qs">Quaerit disputando</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">de quo Judaeis: <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e281" source="http://scta.info/resource/io8_44@1-5">Vos ex patre diabolo estis</quote>.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov23-d1e286">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1107A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e290" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_29@6-9">Cui rixae? cui foveae? Rixae,</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e293"><seg type="qs">quia concordiam non servat</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et saepissime in foveam incidit, de qua: <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e299" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_27@1-5">Fovea enim profunda est meretrix,</quote> etc.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov23-d1e304">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e306" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_29@10-13">Cui sine causa vulnera?</quote>
            quia multi nimis potati vulnera per tumorem acceperunt, quae nulla ferri causa pertulerunt.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov23-d1e310">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e312" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_29@14-16">Cui suffossio oculorum?</quote>
            quia immoderatus haustus vini, et exterioris et interioris visus ingerit caecitatem.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov23-Dd1e317">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov23-Hd1e319">Versus 30</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov23-d1e321">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e323" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_30@1-2">Nonne his.</quote>
            Non vetat bibere vinum ad necessitatem, sed morari extra tempus et utilitatem in vino, et evacuandis certare calicibus, unde Isaias: <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e326" source="http://scta.info/resource/is5_22@1-13">Vae qui potentes estis ad bibendum vinum, et viri fortes ad miscendam ebrietatem</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov23-Dd1e331">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov23-Hd1e333">Versus 33</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov23-d1e335">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e337" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_33@1-3">Oculi tui videbunt.</quote>
            Pene naturale <pb ed="#P" n="1107B"/> vitium est, post vina in corde mulierem concupiscere, comitante etiam turpitudine verborum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov23-Dd1e344">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov23-Hd1e346">Versus 34</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov23-d1e348">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e350" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_34@1-4">Et eris sicut dormiens.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e353"><seg type="qs">In medio mari dormiunt</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">studium sollicitudinis perdit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov23-Dd1e362">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov23-Hd1e364">Versus 35</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov23-d1e366">
            <ref xml:id="gom-prov23-Rd1e368" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_35"/>
            ;
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov23-d1e371">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e373" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov23_35@3-4">Verberaverunt me.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov23-Qd1e376"><seg type="qs">Vox percussi est et dormientis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ut semper voluptatibus debrietur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
